      "side": 1,
      "message": "The object implementing Item.NetworkInterface.InfiniBand also implements\nItem.NetworkInterface, and is linked to the Port through the\nassigned_to/assigning association added in\nhttps://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/phosphor-dbus-interfaces/+/89649\n\n```\n          +----------------------------------------------+\n          |            NetworkAdapter  (89247)           |\n          +----------------------------------------------+\n           |                                            |\nconnecting |                                            | exposing\n   (89247) |                                            | (89649)\n           v                                            v\n+----------------------+                 +-----------------------------+\n| Connector.Port       |                 | NetworkInterface            |\n|                      |\u003c- assigned_to --| NetworkInterface.InfiniBand |\n| PortProtocol:        |     (89649)     |   (92492)                   |\n|   Ethernet   (89248) |                 |   PermanentNodeGUID         |\n|   InfiniBand (95051) |                 |   PermanentPortGUID         |\n|                      |                 |                             |\n+----------------------+                 +-----------------------------+\n\nReverse names: connected_to, exposed_by, assigning\n```",
